This repository packages MoneyPrinterTurbo for Railway.

MoneyPrinterTurbo (https://github.com/harry0703/MoneyPrinterTurbo) is
Copyright (c) 2024 Harry and licensed under the MIT License. The image builds
the pinned release from source; its license is installed at
/usr/share/doc/moneyprinterturbo-railway/MoneyPrinterTurbo-LICENSE and at
/app/LICENSE.

Changes made to the MoneyPrinterTurbo source (scripts/prepare-source.sh):

  * The bundled background music (resource/songs) is removed. Upstream's
    README states it was taken from YouTube videos; it is not covered by the
    MIT license.
  * The bundled fonts Microsoft YaHei (Microsoft Corporation), STHeiti
    (Changzhou SinoType Technology) and UTM Kabel KT are removed. They are not
    licensed for redistribution.
  * The default subtitle font named in the code is changed from those fonts
    to Noto Sans CJK.
  * Documentation, tests and CI files are not copied into the image.

Fonts shipped in the image:

  * Noto Sans CJK, Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), SIL Open
    Font License 1.1. From the Debian package fonts-noto-cjk; its copyright
    file is installed at
    /usr/share/doc/moneyprinterturbo-railway/NotoSansCJK-copyright.
  * Be Vietnam Pro, Copyright 2021 The Be Vietnam Pro Project Authors, SIL Open
    Font License 1.1 (licenses/OFL-BeVietnamPro.txt).
  * Charm, Copyright 2018 The Charm Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1
    (licenses/OFL-Charm.txt).

